{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28181","headline":"哀蜀人爲南蛮俘虏五章 过大渡河蛮使许之泣望乡国 · 雍陶","name":"哀蜀人爲南蛮俘虏五章 过大渡河蛮使许之泣望乡国","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大渡河边蛮亦愁，汉人将渡尽回头。\n此中剩寄思乡泪，南去应无水北流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28181.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28181","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}